WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.920
Another Thing That Doctor Bright is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:08.320
He’s no longer allowed to challenge Able&nbsp;
to unwinnable games like tic-tac-toe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.120
It was three weeks before Able conceded a draw.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:16.960
It probably shouldn’t surprise you that Able,&nbsp;
legendary swordsman and component of SCP-076,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.200
both takes himself very seriously and&nbsp;
has a bit of a competitive streak.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.440
That’s why Dr. Bright enjoys getting under&nbsp;
his skin by challenging him to pointless and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:30.240
unwinnable games like tic-tac-toe, just&nbsp;
to watch him get steamed. The problem is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.480
when Able gets steamed, there tends to&nbsp;
be a large amount of collateral damage.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.640
That’s why, during containment breaches.&nbsp;
Dr. Bright is advised to keep himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:42.400
and his snakes and ladders board&nbsp;
well away from the affected area.

